  "rationale": "86 units of Cheese Slices 500ML at Outlet 03 (South Bengaluru) are projected unsold before the expiry deadline on 2026-09-19; doing nothing writes off ₹6956 and a blanket 20% markdown costs ₹2156. This play uses a bundle with SKU-MULTIGRAIN-BREAD-400G at ₹159 for 302 consented customers (Dairy occasionals, Tea connoisseurs, Everyday staples shoppers, Sweets occasionals, Personal care regulars, Festival sweets loyalists): expected 27 units, margin ₹343, discount cost ₹429, waste avoided ₹2167 (CI 1 to 78 units; prior n 20, measured n 0). Policy v1: \"2. Prefer bundles and transfers over blanket markdowns; markdowns are the last lever.\" This bundle play pairs the cheese slices with multigrain bread at a price of 159 INR, which satisfies the 8% margin floor for dairy and is preferred over markdowns by the policy. It avoids 2166.78 INR of waste by clearing an estimated 26.79 units.",
